{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800900/extras/5ff128249f6331e8861a8807ce57261b.avif?t=1751837237\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800900/extras_big/5ff128249f6331e8861a8807ce57261b.avif?t=1751837237 width=800 height=450 /></span>Simple Zombie Survival | A razor-sharp, wave-based FPS built from the ground up with heart by a solo dev who lives and breathes zombie games...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is overrun by undead, the Pixel Pod have been beamed down\u2014elite cybernetic warriors with only their metal and a singular purpose: to destroy the\u00a0<strong>Simple Zombies and ensure the Earth's Survival</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or in pods of <strong>up to 4 people</strong>, discover secrets,  unlock achievements (coming soon) and compete for the the ultimate global high score (online leader boards coming soon). Master a fast-paced arsenal, of over 20 unique weapons from modern, WW2 era and Space-Age, and enhance your abilities by unlocking <strong>perks and game-changing power-ups</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive the simple zombies?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800900?t=1751837237","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800900/6d58f50ef8bf8e996b76f8161fae155def728228/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751837237","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800900/4d4c0b5e7e9ba47d742a647a2b94b531c0e13446/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751837237","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800900/4d4c0b5e7e9ba47d742a647a2b94b531c0e13446/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751837237","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi